load @term/seed/tensor
  find tensor

# The torsion tensor: the part of a connection that measures the failure of infinitesimal parallelograms to close, the
# twisting of a space independent of its bending. A connection with zero torsion is symmetric, and general relativity
# uses the unique torsion-free metric connection. The form carries the underlying tensor.
form torsion-tensor
  link tensor, like tensor
